/mutants.out/
/mutants.out.old/
# SQLite write-ahead sidecars + pid/lock files (transient)
*.db-shm
*.db-wal
*.pid
# Test/runtime pollution (tests writing relative to CWD instead of a tempdir).
# Generalizes the orchestrator workflow rule to every crate (F-13 wrote archives
# under crates/contracts/workflow/sessions/). Also catches the e25 edit-checkpoint
# test that materialized a literal "C/Users/.../Temp/..." path under the crate dir,
# the runtime memory store, and a stray select_parent file from the darwin loop.
crates/*/workflow/
crates/*/C/Users/
memory/*.sqlite
/select_parent
# codegraph live index (SQLite call-graph, ~132MB, machine-local, auto-rebuilt). Never commit.
.codegraph/

# K-18a: generated case-reuse bench run reports (blake3-pinned JSON + future .rra) are runtime output, not source. Fixtures live under crates/orchestrator/src/benchmarks/case_reuse_fixtures/ and ARE tracked.
benchmarks/case_reuse/
